  "description": "LUVQEA crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C72 H122 Co2 Dy4 N2 O32,2(C5 H10 O2),5(H2 O1),2(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Co5 (Co) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Co2 (Co) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 7 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 2.902-4.013 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.90-122.17°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C72H122Co2Dy4N2O32,2(C5H10O2),5(H2O),2(CH4O). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
